<div id="bl">

<!-- ====== HERO ====== -->
<section id="hero">
  <div class="hero-bg"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0701/8437/0218/t/3/assets/hero-hydro-wide.png" alt="The Barnacle lifestyle" fetchpriority="high" /></div>
  <div class="hero-ov"></div>
  <div class="hero-content">
    <h1>Your drink's new<br><em>best friend.</em></h1>
    <p class="hero-sub">The portable, multi-use beverage holder that grips any flat surface &mdash; on the water, on the road, or wherever the day takes you.</p>
    <div class="hero-ctas">
      <a href="#buy" class="btn-p">
        <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
        Get Your Barnacle
      </a>
      <a href="#features" class="btn-o">Learn More</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="scroll-hint"><span>&#8595;</span></div>
</section>

<!-- ====== FEATURES ====== -->
<section id="features">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <h2 class="sec-title">Tired of having nowhere to put your drink?</h2>
      <p class="sec-sub">Every flat surface is a cup holder now. The Barnacle sticks, grips, and holds &mdash; so you can stop worrying about your drink and start enjoying the moment.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="pain-grid">
      <div class="pain-card">
        <div class="pain-icon">&#127754;</div>
        <h3>Boats have zero cup holders</h3>
        <p>You're out on the water, waves are rolling, and your drink is sliding across the deck. The Barnacle fixes that permanently &mdash; no drilling, no installation.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="pain-card">
        <div class="pain-icon">&#128663;</div>
        <h3>Flat surfaces everywhere, zero grip</h3>
        <p>Truck dash, cooler lid, kayak deck, tailgate rail &mdash; none of them hold your drink. Until now. The Barnacle's suction base grips any smooth flat surface.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="pain-card">
        <div class="pain-icon">&#129380;</div>
        <h3>Works with everything you drink from</h3>
        <p>12 oz cans, 20 oz bottles, 30 oz tumblers, 40 oz Stanleys &mdash; the flexible silicone ring expands and contracts to hold virtually any drink securely.</p>
      </div>
